L000262	    \caption{
L000263	        Extracted relative RVs for CD\mbox{-}35 2722 B with best-fitting one-satellite and two-satellite models. All BJD, RV, and RV error values are available in Appendix A, with the full corner plot for the favored model in Appendix B.
L000264	    }
L000265	    \label{fig:orbit}
